{% ctaSection
   heading="The Story behind BOLD"
   description="BOLD—Biblically Oriented Leadership Development—was born from the desire to prepare young adults for more than a career while giving them opportunities to engage the workforce and try different job interests. We want to help them understand who they are in Christ, why they believe what they believe, and how their faith shapes the way they work, lead, serve, rest, and engage the world."
